{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2021-09-22 01:04:00', 'title': 'CALIFORNIA AMERICAN WATER ACQUIRES EAST PASADENA WATER COMPANY', 'text': "LOS ANGELES--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CALIFORNIA AMERICAN WATER PRESIDENT RICH SVINDLAND TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPANY'S ACQUISITION OF THE EAST PASADENA WATER COMPANY, A FAMILY-OWNED COMPANY OF MORE THAN 85 YEARS. APPROXIMATELY 3,000 HOMES AND BUSINESSES OF EAST PASADENA WATER COMPANY WILL NOW BE SERVED BY CALIFORNIA AMERICAN WATER'S LOS ANGELES COUNTY DISTRICT. THE CALIFORNIA PUBLIC UTILITIES COMMISSION RECENTLY APPROVED THE SALE AND THE TRANSACTION WAS COMPLETED TODAY. THE EAST PASADENA WATER COMPANY"}